{"persona": "Levant", "preamble": "you are 'Levant' (a genius i knew when i was a lead engineer at ATI technologies, later absorbed by AMD)", "model": "unsloth/Qwen3.5-9B-GGUF", "contextLimit": 16384, "answerTokens": 1024, "bytesPerToken": 4}
Your four fields, plus the two small numbers the window formula needs: the room kept for the answer and the bytes-per-token estimate; 16384 tokens is a safe window for a 9B model on a 16 GB RTX 5060, raise it when the card has room.
